 le strategie possibili per far sì che il ragazzo si senta a disagio nella vita familiare. L'obiettivo verrà raggiunto?","tagline":"Regola n°1 - MAI abbandonare la casa di Mamma e Papà"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Tanguy is 28 years old and still living with his parents. They think it's time he moves out. He doesn't, so they hatch a plan.","tagline":"At 28, he still lives with his parents"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Paul et Edith Guetz, un riche couple de cinquantenaires, ne supportent plus que Tanguy, leur grand fils modèle de 28 ans, vive toujours au domicile familial. Ce dernier a beau être brillant et charmant, ses parents vont faire de son existence un enfer pour le forcer à quitter leur luxueux appartement.","tagline":"A 28 ans, il habite toujours chez ses parents"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/twnzCGzKYnsl5TI1QTfijlkzf2e.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dIj2vSBgK6KN3FVEZJFwGrz3tAB.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":2029,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/twnzCGzKYnsl5TI1QTfijlkzf2e.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/twnzCGzKYnsl5TI1QTfijlkzf2e.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/twnzCGzKYnsl5TI1QTfijlkzf2e.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/twnzCGzKYnsl5TI1QTfijlkzf2e.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"fr":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hTSALpAPB5ANmplvBqwChgv1Hun.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hTSALpAPB5ANmplvBqwChgv1Hun.jpg","language":"fr","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.